00:49:51,808 --> 00:49:52,368
That's it.

524
00:49:52,686 --> 00:49:53,828
You've just added a loader.

525
00:49:54,094 --> 00:50:02,048
So open up the home page, check your terminal and reload, and you'll see the loading data for the forward slash route console log.

