629
00:59:09,262 --> 00:59:17,124
But when the user clicks around your application like a standard single-page app, the loader will execute directly inside of the browser.

630
00:59:17,422 --> 00:59:25,252
And because of that, you absolutely cannot put secret API keys or raw database queries inside of a loader.

